# Hippias, priest at the altar of Apollo on the hill. Three questions: who the
# fire is for, what the blocks are for, whether he has time. No errand.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
Hippias: NPC_PRIEST_1
- LOC_PRIEST_CHOICE_1
	Hippias: LOC_PRIEST_GOD_1
	Hippias: LOC_PRIEST_GOD_2
- LOC_PRIEST_CHOICE_2
	Hippias: LOC_PRIEST_STONES_1
	Hippias: LOC_PRIEST_STONES_2
- LOC_PRIEST_CHOICE_3
	Hippias: LOC_PRIEST_TIME_1
	Hippias: LOC_PRIEST_TIME_2
=> END
